    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146980/extras/fa6773ea969d429ec9083b143ecbef73.avif?t=1754855834\" width=640 height=360 /></span>Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beloved Firefighter</strong> is a <u>survival horror game</u>. In order to survive, player must run or hide from the enemies. <strong>Combat</strong> is not possible and attempts to confront an enemy will result in <strong>death</strong>. Players can hide besides pillars and doors. Also the player must complete the objectives such as <strong>picklocking doors, collecting notes about the story, power the generators to make his way</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146980/extras/eec260c81e16268d587f3457de610900.avif?t=1754855834\" width=148 height=172 /></span>\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Story\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Beloved Firefighter&quot;</strong> invites players to a deep emotional and psychological horror experience. Our main character, a respected firefighter in the city, is confronted with his past mistakes. After his ex-girlfriend was diagnosed with <strong>schizophrenia</strong>, he became emotionally lost and cheated on her. Months later, the betrayed ex-girlfriend, unable to cope with the betrayal, sets her own house on fire. The firefighter, in an attempt to save her, rushes into the flames, initiating a horror-filled rescue operation. Players will be drawn into both physical and psychological terror as they witness the firefighter confronting his past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146980/extras/fa6773ea969d429ec9083b143ecbef73.avif?t=1754855834\" width=640 height=360 /></span>Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beloved Firefighter</strong> is a <u>survival horror game</u>. In order to survive, player must run or hide from the enemies. <strong>Combat</strong> is not possible and attempts to confront an enemy will result in <strong>death</strong>. Players can hide besides pillars and doors. Also the player must complete the objectives such as <strong>picklocking doors, collecting notes about the story, power the generators to make his way</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146980/extras/eec260c81e16268d587f3457de610900.avif?t=1754855834\" width=148 height=172 /></span>\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Story\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Beloved Firefighter&quot;</strong> invites players to a deep emotional and psychological horror experience. Our main character, a respected firefighter in the city, is confronted with his past mistakes. After his ex-girlfriend was diagnosed with <strong>schizophrenia</strong>, he became emotionally lost and cheated on her. Months later, the betrayed ex-girlfriend, unable to cope with the betrayal, sets her own house on fire. The firefighter, in an attempt to save her, rushes into the flames, initiating a horror-filled rescue operation. Players will be drawn into both physical and psychological terror as they witness the firefighter confronting his past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
